<h2>Thank you for your order!</h2>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>We've received your order <strong>#<%= @order.number %></strong> and are getting it ready for shipment.</p>
<p>Order Summary:</p>
<ul>
  <% @order.line_items.each do |item| %>
    <li><%= item.product.name %> x <%= item.quantity %> (<%= item.display_amount.to_s %>)</li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
<p><strong>Total: <%= @order.display_total.to_s %></strong></p>
<p>You can view your order status and details here: <a href="http://localhost:3000/orders/<%= @order.number %>">Order Details</a></p>
<p>Thanks for shopping with us!</p>
